{
  "bodyHash": "e87f91d17e2682e0",
  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/17690401/206918778-f71443ec-e7c4-4957-8e1d-20746c8f110e.png\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/l6TLfNC.png\" width=\"700\"></a><br><br><span style=\"font-size:24px\">一个基于原版的小地图/世界视图模组，引入“地图集”概念。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Fabric 版本请查看 <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/map-atlases\" rel=\"nofollow\">此处<br></a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><em>谁曾想到，要获得小地图只需将地图放在书上即可？</em></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/M4RFrLC.png\" width=\"650\" height=\"618\"><a href=\"https://twitter.com/i/status/1740926558242824281\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">演示视频</a><br><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/map-atlases\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/9d736021b45edad0abf97481dc6653a02a7bbefe526c4944d615fbf7f00cf769/68747470733a2f2f63662e776179326d7563686e6f6973652e65752f66756c6c5f3433363239385f646f776e6c6f6164732e737667\" alt=\"Curseforge\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://modrinth.com/mod/map-atlases\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/7895077c316d03696ab7c31bdd3d6750e6610b891f552e8c213f3af6c46fc7de/68747470733a2f2f696d672e736869656c64732e696f2f6d6f6472696e74682f64742f6d61702d61746c617365733f6c6162656c3d4D6f6472696e7468253230446f776e6c6f616473\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Pepperoni-Jabroni/MapAtlases\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/10a1b2aca988be3faa47dcf672987f9e5de99d5fd4781d09a08e4925331daaa2/68747470733a2f2f696d672e736869656c64732e696f2f6769746875622f646f776e6c6f6164732f5065707065726f6e692d4A6162726f6e692f4D617041746c617365732f746f74616c3f6c6162656c3d446f776e6c6f616473266c6f676f3d676974687562\" alt=\"GitHub\"></a></p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\">📖&nbsp;简介📖</span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/eGeCLL9.png\" alt=\"crafting_toast\" width=\"900\" height=\"113\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">使用已填充的地图、一本书和一些粘性物品（如粘液球或蜜桶）进行合成</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">原始地图决定了地图集的比例尺。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">通过合成台或制图台向地图集中添加已填充或空白地图以扩展其范围。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">添加的<strong>必须</strong>保持相同比例尺。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">可使用剪刀在合成台中移除地图。若使用<strong>制图台</strong>可更精确控制。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">可配置为使用纸张代替地图来增加空白地图的成本。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">也支持来自其他模组的地图，如<strong>Supplementaries切片地图</strong>或<strong>Twilight Forest魔法与迷宫地图</strong>。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">地图集可在制图台中复制和合并<br><br></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/z8PMFE7.png\" alt=\"exploring_toast\" width=\"900\" height=\"113\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">地图集会在屏幕左上角显示<strong>小地图</strong>。仅当地图集处于活动状态时生效（默认位于快捷栏或副手）。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">进入未探索区域时会消耗空白地图并生成新地图，从而扩展地图集。（创造模式无需此操作）</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">可通过按住 Shift 点击地图集<strong>锁定</strong>，防止生成新地图。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">地图集支持<strong>跨维度运作</strong>，会自动在新维度中生成对应地图。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">小地图可额外显示当前坐标（X/Y/Z）、朝向及所在生物群系信息。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">小地图可切换为跟随玩家旋转，或使用基于网格的原版地图系统。<br></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">在提供“地图装饰”功能的方块（如旗帜）上使用地图集会将其加入地图集。也可按<strong>b</strong>键实现相同效果。</span><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><br><br></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/iAwhE07.png\" alt=\"navigating_toast\" width=\"900\" height=\"113\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">同时也会添加一张世界地图：</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">右键点击地图集或持有活动时按下<strong>m</strong>键即可访问。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">也可将地图台放置于<strong>讲台</strong>上并从那里访问世界地图。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">每个维度或已探索区域的切片都可设置书签。选择可切换视图。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">为每个维度中添加的地图装饰提供可选标签页。点击后会将视图中心对准该位置。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">鼠标悬停点会显示当前的 X/Z 坐标。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">支持滚轮缩放。按 Shift 可加速缩放。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">支持全屏拖动移动地图。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">在地图装饰书签上按 Shift + 单击可删除。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">可配置世界地图采用更大尺寸的“书本”样式而非方形外观。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">创造模式下可直接在世界地图中使用<strong>传送</strong>功能：按住 Shift 任意点击即可。<br><br></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/yWkAulk.png\" alt=\"integration_toast\" width=\"900\" height=\"113\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">与以下模组联用时地图集将具备额外功能：<br><br></span><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:18px\"><strong>Moonlight Lib：</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>路标</strong>可通过点击路标“红色图钉”按钮或按 b 键添加。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">路标仅<strong>客户端可见</strong>，其他玩家无法看到。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">按住 Shift 可放置命名路标或更改颜色。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">在命名路标编辑界面，可点击路标图标或使用<strong>滚轮</strong>更改其<strong>颜色</strong>。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">已放置的路标不可编辑，但可通过 Shift 点击移除。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">可通过点击 + Ctrl 快捷键<strong>瞄准</strong>某个路标。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">被瞄准的路标始终会显示在小地图边缘。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">可在配置中自动转换 Xaero 小地图的路标。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>实体雷达</strong>可启用，允许在小地图上以小型标记形式显示附近生物。<br><br><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:18px\"><strong>Supplementaries</strong></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>自定义地图标记</strong>可作为常规标记添加到地图集。详见 Supplementaries Wiki 支持的方块列表。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>切片地图</strong>可添加到地图集。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">这将允许你绘制<strong>下界</strong>地图。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">可通过按键绑定或世界地图中的“切片地图”书签切换当前查看的切片。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">一旦进入某切片，地图集将继续为该切片生成地图。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">配置可自动将小地图视图切换到最接近 Y 轴高度的切片。<br></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">可使用古董墨水制作<strong>古旧地图集</strong>。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">世界地图底部会增加“地图类型”按钮，用箭头键循环 Y 轴高度。点击按钮可循环地图类型（例如从 TF 迷宫地图切换至原版地图）。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">地图将使用<strong>彩色地图</strong>模组的生物群系着色功能。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">夜间地图会使用<strong>区块光照</strong>。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>死亡标记</strong>持有复苏指南针时显示</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:18px\"><strong>Curio</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">可将地图集放入 Curio 的手部槽位。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:18px\"><strong>Twilight Forest</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">魔法地图和迷宫地图可添加至地图集。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">在世界地图界面使用<strong>地图类型按钮</strong>可在两者间切换。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:18px\"><strong>Heartstones</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><del></del><span style=\"font-size:18px\">显示其他玩家的爱心标记位置</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\">📸 截图📸</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">小地图实际效果</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/kQS6Gqd.png\" alt=\"Minimap\" width=\"335\" height=\"378\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">添加自定义路标</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/LEdMUCD.png\" alt=\"Adding a custom pin\" width=\"400\" height=\"185\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">移除地图</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/aBmhMKI.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"500\" height=\"249\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">聚焦路标</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/MnxCpVP.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"500\" height=\"238\"></span></p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">制作地图集</span></h2>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/17690401/175755582-aecd94b1-ac3a-4686-a3d5-82cea1e3583d.png\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/17690401/175755582-aecd94b1-ac3a-4686-a3d5-82cea1e3583d.png\" alt=\"2022-06-24_19 46 45\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/17690401/175755583-83e57650-ce2b-49e3-93e6-a0cf67ff1d0d.png\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/17690401/175755583-83e57650-ce2b-49e3-93e6-a0cf67ff1d0d.png\" alt=\"2022-06-24_19 47 16\"></a></p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">向地图集中添加更多地图</span></h2>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/17690401/175755596-5895ebab-b1a2-4c8-bc70-dcb03083762f.png\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/17690401/175755596-5895ebab-b1a2-4c8-bc70-dcb03083762f.png\" alt=\"2022-06-24_19 48 05\"></a></p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">移动位置时渲染当前地图</span></h2>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/17690401/182008727-dd3a0d38-b493-4367-8b9e-cf74442373a.gif\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/17690401/182008727-dd3a0d38-b493-4367-8b9e-cf74442373a.gif\" alt=\"java_VKNugiTAlO (online-video-cutter\"></a></p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">自定义提示框</span></h2>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/17690401/175755670-3819eca7-cbc4-4be5-a7c8-3d4286dacd19.png\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/17690401/175755670-3819eca7-cbc4-4be5-a7c8-3d4286dacd19.png\" alt=\"2022-06-24_19 48 21\"></a></p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">从地图集中裁切出地图</span></h2>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/17690401/175755627-bf5ff6b5-752d-4bfd-85d2-82c863bc1257.png\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/17690401/175755627-bf5ff6b5-752d-4bfd-85d2-82c863bc1257.png\" alt=\"2022-06-24_19 48 45\"></a></p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">合并两个地图集</span></h2>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/17690401/175755632-2c6d953d-2ce2-4020-b2ff-ee5cd85aa6f6.png\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/17690401/175755632-2c6d953d-2ce2-4020-b2ff-ee5cd85aa6f6.png\" alt=\"2022-06-24_19 46 20\"></a></p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">批量向地图集中添加空白地图</span></h2><html><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/17690401/175755635-751ed66c-11f2-448e-96e4-7cf20d2ddc07.png\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/17690401/175755635-751ed66c-11f2-448e-96e4-7cf20d2ddc07.png\" alt=\"2022-06-24_19 46 08\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">古旧地图册</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/f7mD2Bt.png\" width=\"600\"></p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">支持Curios模组</span></h2>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/LUshA60.png\" alt=\"展示对Curios模组的支持\" width=\"900\" height=\"506\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">在下界中以替代纹理查看切片地图</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ddiaPl8.png\" width=\"900\" height=\"622\"></h2>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">支持讲台</span></h2>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/17690401/199161203-4cbfc68d-e817-46c2-8e80-36e2950af26f.png\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/17690401/199161203-4cbfc68d-e817-46c2-8e80-36e2950af26f.png\" alt=\"map_atlases_v220_promo\" width=\"900\"></a></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">现代风格资源包照片示例</span></h2>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/17690401/190546424-894fc024-884f-4cea-a8e4-0315643fb7f9.png\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/17690401/190546424-894fc024-884f-4cea-a8e4-0315643fb7f9.png\" alt=\"2022-09-15_19 51 51\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/17690401/190546249-388c58b5-99de-463c-b0d8-d3c40ebb4c33.png\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/17690401/190546249-388c58b5-99de-463c-b0d8-d3c40ebb4c33.png\" alt=\"2022-09-15_19 50 29\"></a></p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\">⚙️配置选项⚙️</span></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">本模组高度可自定义（可使用如Configured、YACL等配置菜单模组，或直接手动编辑配置文件）。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\">⛓关联模组⛓</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">可选依赖项：</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/curios\" rel=\"nofollow\">Curios</a>（手持槽位）</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/selene\" rel=\"nofollow\">Moonlight Lib</a>（别针、实体雷达、光图、Xaero waypoints支持）</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/supplementaries\" rel=\"nofollow\">Supplementaries</a>（切片地图、可探索洞穴和下界）</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>Immediately Fast</strong>（更快的地图渲染速度）</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>Twilight Forest</strong>（魔法和迷宫地图支持）<br><br></span><span style=\"font-size:18px\">已知不兼容模组</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/accurate-maps\" rel=\"nofollow\">精准地图</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-portals-mod rel=rel=\"rel\"\" rel=\"nofollow\">沉浸式传送门<br></a></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">推荐补充内容</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">更廉价的地图合成数据包&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Pepperoni-Jabroni/MapAtlases/releases/download/2.0.1/cheaper-map-crafting%201.19.zip\" rel=\"nofollow\">[1.19]</a>&nbsp;– 为什么地图需要指南针？该数据包为空白地图添加了仅由1张纸+1个墨囊合成的配方。若不想使用纸张消耗设置则此方案为替代选择。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">可选“现代”风格资源包&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Pepperoni-Jabroni/MapAtlases/releases/download/2.1.0/map_atlases_modern_resource_pack%201.19.zip\" rel=\"nofollow\">[1.19]</a>&nbsp;– 此资源包使小地图和世界地图呈现“现代”风格，放弃原版地图纹理样式。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\">🏆致谢🏆</span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://freesound.org/people/InspectorJ/sounds/416179/\" rel=\"nofollow\">图册开启音效</a>，感谢InspectorJ</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://freesound.org/people/flag2/sounds/63318/\" rel=\"nofollow\">图册翻页音效</a>，感谢flag2</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://freesound.org/people/Tomoyo+Ichijouji/sounds/211247/\" rel=\"nofollow\">图册新建地图音效</a>，感谢Tomoyo Ichijouji</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>&nbsp;</h2></html>",
